rn-complete:source_review22-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"kwa_vwt_q4h","source_quote":"林邑有金山，金汁流出於浦。事尼乾道，鑄金銀人像，大十圍。元嘉二十二年，交州刺史檀和之伐林邑，楊邁欲輸金萬斤，銀十萬斤，銅三十萬斤，還日南地。大臣䓯僧達諫，不聽。和之進兵破其北界犬戎區栗城，獲金寶無笇，毀其金人，得黃金數萬斤，餘物稱是。和之後病死，見胡神為祟。孝建二年，始以林邑長史范龍跋為揚武將軍。","reading":"金山、尼乾道在前。交州檀和之與林邑所請輸金從元嘉二十二年起敘，另見二十三年對文。","note":"金山、尼乾道在前。交州檀和之與林邑所請輸金從元嘉二十二年起敘，另見二十三年對文。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p022","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":149,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:variant_review22-28","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"kwa_vwt_q4h","source_quote":"元嘉二十二年，交州刺史檀和之伐林邑","reading":"本卷二十二，南史與宋文帝紀有二十三年明文；出師與克城是否同年另待可接原文。","note":"本卷二十二，南史與宋文帝紀有二十三年明文；出師與克城是否同年另待可接原文。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p022","start_codepoint":28,"end_codepoint":45,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi058-champayangmai-father","subject_person_id":"kwa_vwt_q4h","object_person_id":"3pw_93l_f9d","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"楊邁死，子咄立"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-058","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete-ws2638629","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p021","quote":"宋永初元年，林邑王范楊邁初產，母夢人以金席藉之，光色奇麗。中國謂紫磨金，夷人謂之「楊邁」，故以為名。楊邁死，子咄立，慕其父，復改名楊邁。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p021:m0055","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-058-southern-and-eastern-complete:p021:m0009"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"區分父原名與子更名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"